- **Breaking change:** Fleet ignores the `FLEET_JIT_USER_ROLE_TEAM_<FLEET_ID>` SAML attribute. Rename it to `FLEET_JIT_USER_ROLE_FLEET_<FLEET_ID>` in your identity provider before upgrading. Until you do, a new user whose fleet roles come only from the old attribute is created as a global observer, and the fleet roles of an existing user are no longer updated when they log in.
